    {
      "id": "claim_f04c091a566948debe855d45a2f6a769",
      "statement": "The codebase contains two separate, unmerged audit concepts per a TODO in cmd/server/main.go: internal/audit.Logger records per-action-execution authorization decisions and outcomes but is wired only as audit.NewMockLogger with no persistent backend, while middleware.NewAuditLogger persists one AuditEntry row per HTTP request to the store, queryable via GET /audit; the per-action decision/outcome trail is not currently part of the persisted audit trail.",
      "evidence": [
